msgctxt "100"
msgid "Hello? Is this Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Yeah, that's me. Who's this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"I'm calling from Adam, a host club in Kamurocho. Do you know a girl named "
"Yui?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Yui? Is her last name Hatano?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's the one. Unfortunately, she's caused a disturbance at our "
"club, and is refusing to leave..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "She kept yelling, \"Call Kiryu-san! Call Kiryu-san!\" so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "I'm sorry to bother you, sir, but could you please come pick her up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

